YOUR SENIOR FULL-STACK INTERVIEW PLAN

Target: November 15, 2026
Daily Study Time: 4 hours
Experience: 7 years

Your JavaScript is your strongest skill, so we'll use it as the
foundation and prioritize React, Node.js, coding rounds, and
senior-level system design.

